Upstream attribution
---------------------------------------------------------------------

Shepherd is a fork of herdr, an open-source terminal workspace manager and
runtime for coding agents:

    herdr            https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr
    website          https://herdr.dev
    license          Apache License 2.0
    copyright        the herdr authors and contributors ("the herdr contributors")
    base version     0.9.5

The terminal multiplexer, pseudo-terminal management, session persistence,
agent screen detection, client/server protocol, socket API, plugin system and
the rest of the herdr code base in this repository are the work of the herdr
contributors and remain under their copyright and the Apache-2.0 license.
Their history is preserved in this repository's git log.

Changes made to the upstream herdr files (Apache-2.0, section 4(b)):
files carry the modifications listed in SHEPHERD.md, section "Archivos de
herdr modificados" (renaming to "shepherd", configuration paths, and the small
hooks that connect the orchestrator to the multiplexer). The git history shows
every change line by line.

